          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"services.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Offerings — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Holistic and integrative services for whole-person wellbeing.\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg1:#f6fffb;--bg2:#fffaf6;--accent:#6b8e6f;--muted:#6b6b6b;--card:#ffffff}\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial}\\n    body{background:linear-gradient(120deg,var(--bg1),var(--bg2));color:#0b2b2a;line-height:1.45}\\n    header{position:relative;padding:28px 24px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-left:18px;font-weight:600}\\n    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}\\n    .logo{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:12px;display:grid;place-items:center;color:white;font-weight:700;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8bbf93,#4b7a6a)}\\n    main{max-width:980px;margin:28px auto;padding:28px}\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:28px;align-items:start}\\n    .hero .lead{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.7),transparent);padding:28px;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(27,38,36,0.06)}\\n    .kicker{color:var(--accent);font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px}\\n    h1{margin:6px 0 12px;font-size:28px}\\n    p.lead-muted{color:var(--muted);margin:0}\\n    .panel{background:var(--card);border-radius:12px;padding:20px;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(15,25,23,0.05)}\\n    .service{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(11,43,42,0.04);margin-bottom:12px}\\n    .dot{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#e6fbf2,#d7efe3);display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--accent);font-weight:700}\\n    .svc-title{font-weight:700;margin:0}\\n    .svc-desc{margin:6px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:15px}\\n    .cta{display:inline-block;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#6b8e6f,#3f6e5a);color:white;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}\\n    footer{max-width:980px;margin:24px auto;padding:18px 28px;border-radius:12px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    /* SVG backdrop */\\n    .backdrop{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:-1;opacity:0.14}\\n    @media(max-width:880px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.logo{display:none}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <svg class=\\\"backdrop\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 800 600\\\" preserveAspectRatio=\\\"xMidYMid slice\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\">\\n    <defs>\\n      <linearGradient id=\\\"g1\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\">\\n        <stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#eaf8f0\\\"/>\\n        <stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#fff9f2\\\"/>\\n      </linearGradient>\\n      <pattern id=\\\"patternServices\\\" width=\\\"120\\\" height=\\\"120\\\" patternUnits=\\\"userSpaceOnUse\\\" patternTransform=\\\"rotate(20)\\\">\\n        <rect width=\\\"120\\\" height=\\\"120\\\" fill=\\\"url(#g1)\\\"/>\\n        <circle cx=\\\"20\\\" cy=\\\"20\\\" r=\\\"6\\\" fill=\\\"#cfe9d7\\\"/>\\n        <circle cx=\\\"80\\\" cy=\\\"80\\\" r=\\\"4\\\" fill=\\\"#dff3e6\\\"/>\\n        <rect x=\\\"0\\\" y=\\\"60\\\" width=\\\"120\\\" height=\\\"6\\\" fill=\\\"#f0fbf6\\\"/>\\n      </pattern>\\n    </defs>\\n    <rect width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" fill=\\\"url(#patternServices)\\\"/>\\n  </svg>\\n\\n  <header>\\n    <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"logo\\\">H</div>\\n      <div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-weight:800\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px\\\">Integrative care with curiosity</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <nav aria-label=\\\"Main navigation\\\">\\n      <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Nest</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Offerings</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"approach.html\\\">How we work</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Connect</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main>\\n    <section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"lead panel\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"kicker\\\">Whole-person care</div>\\n        <h1>Services that listen to your life — not just symptoms</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"lead-muted\\\">We blend traditional wisdom and modern evidence to craft personalized plans. Sessions focus on education, daily rituals, and practical experiments you can integrate immediately.</p>\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:18px;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center\\\">\\n          <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n          <a href=\\\"book.html\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\">Book a consult</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside class=\\\"panel\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"services-summary\\\">\\n        <h3 id=\\\"services-summary\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">Quick snapshot</h3>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 12px\\\">Short &amp; long consultations, personalized plans, herbal guidance, nutrition coaching, and mindful movement prescriptions.</p>\\n        <div style=\\\"display:grid;gap:8px;margin-top:8px\\\">\\n          <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\"><strong>Location:</strong> {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\"><strong>Contact:</strong> <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></div>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:22px\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"margin-bottom:10px\\\">Core offerings</h2>\\n      <div class=\\\"panel\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"service\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"dot\\\">IC</div>\\n          <div>\\n            <p class=\\\"svc-title\\\">Integrative Consultation</p>\\n            <p class=\\\"svc-desc\\\">A deep intake that maps your story: medical history, lifestyle, environment and goals. Builds the foundation for a collaborative care plan.</p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"service\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"dot\\\">HB</div>\\n          <div>\\n            <p class=\\\"svc-title\\\">Herbal & Nutritional Guidance</p>\\n            <p class=\\\"svc-desc\\\">Diet plans and botanical suggestions rooted in safety-first principles. Focused on supporting digestion, energy, sleep and mood.</p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"service\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"dot\\\">AQ</div>\\n          <div>\\n            <p class=\\\"svc-title\\\">Acupuncture & Manual Support</p>\\n            <p class=\\\"svc-desc\\\">Optional modalities to complement lifestyle shifts — offered as a gentle adjunct to the central plan when appropriate.</p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"service\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"dot\\\">CO</div>\\n          <div>\\n            <p class=\\\"svc-title\\\">Coaching & Ritual Design</p>\\n            <p class=\\\"svc-desc\\\">Brief, actionable daily rituals to reinforce habits: breathwork recipes, bedtime protocols, movement cues and check-ins.</p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"service\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"dot\\\">ED</div>\\n          <div>\\n            <p class=\\\"svc-title\\\">Educational Labs & Reports</p>\\n            <p class=\\\"svc-desc\\\">We may discuss optional lab testing as an educational tool. Labs are never mandatory and are interpreted in the context of your whole story.</p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:20px\\\">\\n      <h2>Session formats</h2>\\n      <div class=\\\"panel\\\" style=\\\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <strong>Initial Visit</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"margin:6px 0;color:var(--muted)\\\">Comprehensive intake and first-line plan. 75–90 minutes.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div>\\n          <strong>Follow-ups</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"margin:6px 0;color:var(--muted)\\\">Shorter check-ins to tweak plans, review labs and support habit formation. 30–45 minutes.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div>\\n          <strong>Mini Consults</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"margin:6px 0;color:var(--muted)\\\">Focused 20-minute visits for a narrow question or ritual check.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div>\\n          <strong>Group Workshops</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"margin:6px 0;color:var(--muted)\\\">Seasonal classes on sleep, digestion, stress tools and ritual design.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:20px\\\">\\n      <h2>Pricing snapshot</h2>\\n      <div class=\\\"panel\\\" style=\\\"display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"flex:1;min-width:220px;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px dashed rgba(11,43,42,0.04)\\\">\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:800\\\">Initial consult</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px\\\">75–90 mins — investment varies. Financing available</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style=\\\"flex:1;min-width:220px;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px dashed rgba(11,43,42,0.04)\\\">\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:800\\\">Follow-up</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px\\\">30–45 mins — paced to your needs</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style=\\\"flex:1;min-width:220px;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px dashed rgba(11,43,42,0.04)\\\">\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:800\\\">Mini & workshops</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px\\\">From brief practical check-ins to group tuition</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-top:10px\\\">All pricing is a guide: final fees may vary based on scope. Insurance may cover some services; we can talk details at intake.</p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:22px\\\" class=\\\"panel\\\">\\n      <h3 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">Ready to begin?</h3>\\n      <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Start with an intake and leave with a practical map. We focus on skills you can use today.</p>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\"><a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a></div>\\n    </section>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <footer>\\n    <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap\\\">\\n      <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">© {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n      <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Questions? <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n    </div>\\n  </footer>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"conditions.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Common Concerns — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#fffdf9;--teal:#3b6f63;--muted:#65706b}\\n    body{margin:0;font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Arial;color:#07221f;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#f7fffb)}\\n    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:20px 24px;align-items:center}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-left:16px}\\n    main{max-width:920px;margin:18px auto;padding:20px}\\n    h1{margin:6px 0 6px}\\n    .lead{color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:18px}\\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:14px}\\n    .card{background:white;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(7,34,31,0.04);border:1px solid rgba(11,43,42,0.03)}\\n    .topic-title{font-weight:800;margin:0 0 6px}\\n    .topic-desc{color:var(--muted);margin:0;font-size:14px}\\n    .disclaimer{font-size:13px;color:#796c6c;background:#fff6f6;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;margin-top:12px}\\n    .cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#4d876f,#2f5f4f);color:white;padding:8px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}\\n    footer{max-width:920px;margin:20px auto;padding:12px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    @media(max-width:820px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <header>\\n    <div style=\\\"font-weight:800\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n    <nav>\\n      <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"conditions.html\\\">Health topics</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Services</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main>\\n    <h1>Health topics we commonly support</h1>\\n    <p class=\\\"lead\\\">This is an educational resource: we partner with you to explore patterns, support resilience, and design sustainable health rituals. Nothing here is a guaranteed cure; individualized assessment guides next steps.</p>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <p class=\\\"topic-title\\\">Stress & Burnout</p>\\n        <p class=\\\"topic-desc\\\">Practical strategies to reduce nervous-system strain: rhythm-building, breathing anchors, pacing and environmental tweaks. We emphasize small experiments over drastic fixes.</p>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <p class=\\\"topic-title\\\">Sleep Disturbances</p>\\n        <p class=\\\"topic-desc\\\">Sleep is treated as a learned behavior. We map bedtime cues, light exposure, evening nutrition and targeted rituals to encourage consistent rest.</p>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <p class=\\\"topic-title\\\">Digestive Complaints</p>\\n        <p class=\\\"topic-desc\\\">From bloating to irregularity, support focuses on gentle dietary adjustments, mindful eating practices and safe botanicals when appropriate. Labs may be discussed as educational tools.</p>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <p class=\\\"topic-title\\\">Chronic Inflammation</p>\\n        <p class=\\\"topic-desc\\\">We explore lifestyle drivers of inflammation: sleep, movement, stress and dietary patterns. Interventions aim to reduce triggers and bolster recovery capacity.</p>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <p class=\\\"topic-title\\\">Low Energy & Fatigue</p>\\n        <p class=\\\"topic-desc\\\">A whole-person view looks at sleep quality, nutrition, movement, mood and metabolic signals. We help prioritize tests only when they are likely to inform care.</p>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <p class=\\\"topic-title\\\">Mood & Focus</p>\\n        <p class=\\\"topic-desc\\\">Lifestyle, ritual, and targeted nutrition can shift cognitive resilience. We use measurable small steps and objective check-ins rather than one-size-fits-all prescriptions.</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"disclaimer\\\">\\n      <strong>Important:</strong> This page is informational and not a substitute for medical care. We do not promise cures. If you have severe or acute symptoms (chest pain, difficulty breathing, suicidal thoughts, uncontrolled bleeding), seek urgent medical attention.\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap\\\">\\n      <div style=\\\"flex:1;min-width:220px\\\">\\n        <h3 style=\\\"margin:6px 0\\\">Curious about next steps?</h3>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin:0\\\">Start with a focused consult to map your priorities and safe experimental steps.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <footer>\\n    <div>Contact: <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--teal);text-decoration:none\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> · {{PHONE}}</div>\\n  </footer>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"approach.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Our Process — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#fbfff9;--accent:#2e6b59;--muted:#5c6b64}\\n    body{margin:0;font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#ffffff);color:#07221f}\\n    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:20px 24px;align-items:center}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-left:14px}\\n    main{max-width:920px;margin:18px auto;padding:20px}\\n    .timeline{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}\\n    .step{background:white;border-radius:12px;padding:14px;border-left:6px solid var(--accent);box-shadow:0 8px 28px rgba(14,36,33,0.04)}\\n    .step h3{margin:0 0 6px}\\n    .muted{color:var(--muted)}\\n    .labs{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:8px}\\n    .pill{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#eaf7ef,#f3fff9);padding:8px 10px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid rgba(46,107,89,0.08);font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)}\\n    .cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none}\\n    footer{max-width:920px;margin:20px auto;padding:12px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .bg-svg{position:fixed;right:0;bottom:0;opacity:0.12;z-index:-1}\\n    @media(max-width:820px){.step{padding:12px}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <svg class=\\\"bg-svg\\\" width=\\\"420\\\" height=\\\"320\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 420 320\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\">\\n    <defs>\\n      <linearGradient id=\\\"a\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\"><stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#eefaf1\\\"/><stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#fffdf7\\\"/></linearGradient>\\n      <pattern id=\\\"patternApproach\\\" width=\\\"80\\\" height=\\\"80\\\" patternUnits=\\\"userSpaceOnUse\\\">\\n        <rect width=\\\"80\\\" height=\\\"80\\\" fill=\\\"url(#a)\\\"/>\\n        <path d=\\\"M0 40h80\\\" stroke=\\\"#e6faf0\\\" stroke-width=\\\"6\\\"/>\\n        <circle cx=\\\"60\\\" cy=\\\"20\\\" r=\\\"6\\\" fill=\\\"#d9efe0\\\"/>\\n      </pattern>\\n    </defs>\\n    <rect width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" fill=\\\"url(#patternApproach)\\\"/>\\n  </svg>\\n\\n  <header>\\n    <div style=\\\"font-weight:800\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n    <nav>\\n      <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"approach.html\\\">Our Approach</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">What we offer</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Say hello</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main>\\n    <h1 style=\\\"margin-bottom:6px\\\">How we thoughtfully build your care plan</h1>\\n    <p class=\\\"muted\\\">A collaborative rhythm of intake, gentle experiments, and follow-ups. We prioritize clarity, measurable steps, and safety-first decisions.</p>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"timeline\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"step\\\" id=\\\"intake\\\">\\n          <h3>1 — Intake: we gather the story</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">The first visit is a wide-angle intake: health history, medications, sleep, stressors, daily rhythms and goals. We listen for patterns and start a shared hypothesis — not a one-shot diagnosis.</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"step\\\" id=\\\"plan\\\">\\n          <h3>2 — Personalized plan: practical & prioritized</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Plans contain a short list of doable changes: two to four core actions, a ritual or two, and natural supports when appropriate. Every recommendation is given with rationale and clear expectations.</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"step\\\" id=\\\"labs\\\">\\n          <h3>3 — Optional labs (educational)</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">When useful, we discuss optional laboratory tests as educational tools — to clarify a hypothesis or monitor progress. Labs are never required and always interpreted in context.</p>\\n          <div class=\\\"labs\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"pill\\\">Basic metabolic panel</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"pill\\\">Comprehensive nutrient markers</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"pill\\\">Thyroid screen</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"pill\\\">Targeted GI testing</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"step\\\" id=\\\"follow\\\">\\n          <h3>4 — Follow-ups: iterate & scale</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Short, regular check-ins help us change what isn’t working and reinforce what is. We prefer short cycles of action + reflection to big sudden overhauls.</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"step\\\" id=\\\"safety\\\">\\n          <h3>5 — Safety, integration & referrals</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">We operate within safety limits, consult specialists when needed, and aim to integrate with your existing medical team rather than replace it.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\" class=\\\"step\\\">\\n      <h3 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">What a first plan might look like</h3>\\n      <ul style=\\\"margin:8px 0 0;color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n        <li>One simple sleep ritual to test for two weeks</li>\\n        <li>Dietary adjustment focused on regular meals and chewing practice</li>\\n        <li>A short herbal protocol (if appropriate) with clear stop criteria</li>\\n        <li>Check-in at 3 weeks to review & adapt</li>\\n      </ul>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:16px;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#f5fff8,#ffffff);box-shadow:0 8px 28px rgba(11,43,42,0.03)}\\\">\\n      <h3 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">Frequently asked</h3>\\n      <p style=\\\"margin:8px 0;color:var(--muted)\\\"><strong>Do you promise cures?</strong> No. We focus on education, measurable improvements and whole-person strategies. Expectations are discussed at intake.</p>\\n      <p style=\\\"margin:8px 0;color:var(--muted)\\\"><strong>Are labs required?</strong> Only when they would meaningfully inform care. Labs are optional and presented as tools, not mandates.</p>\\n      <p style=\\\"margin:8px 0;color:var(--muted)\\\"><strong>How long until I feel better?</strong> Timelines vary. We set near-term experiments so you can see small wins within weeks and assess next steps together.</p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <div style=\\\"margin-top:14px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center\\\">\\n      <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n      <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Or call <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></div>\\n    </div>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <footer>\\n    <div style=\\\"max-width:920px;margin:0 auto;padding:12px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Practitioner: {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}} · <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n  </footer>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \nBUNDLE_END"
